#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:140
#: 7c85334afad7403baffdd8fa277f0862
msgid ""
"**Tool Definition**: The ``@register_tool`` decorator registered your "
"tool with ToolUniverse"
msgstr "**工具定义**：``@register_tool`` 装饰器将您的工具注册到 ToolUniverse"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:141
#: ed60e70d1a504c9da2c83c6a8fb1a42d
msgid ""
"**Configuration**: The config dictionary defined the tool's interface and"
