#: 31e2ebf52ba44c40b59e59af15af99d5
msgid "**Implementation**: The ``run()`` method contained your tool's logic"
msgstr "**实现**：``run()`` 方法包含了工具的逻辑"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:143
#: caf36fc1f8ba46b292d3a94ce03e583f
msgid "**Usage**: ToolUniverse automatically discovered and loaded your tool"
msgstr "**使用说明**：ToolUniverse 已自动发现并加载您的工具"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:146
#: 02d4610562f94207bcc6c48bf071b8e9
msgid "Key Concepts Explained"
msgstr "关键概念解析"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:148
#: c80070dcdbe048a7b1d5e571c8650210
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Tool Registration** - ``@register_tool('ToolType', config={...})`` "
"registers your tool - The config defines the tool's name, parameters, and"
" metadata - ToolUniverse automatically discovers registered tools"
msgstr ""
"**工具注册** - ``@register_tool('ToolType', config={...})`` 用于注册您的工具 - "
"配置项定义了工具的名称、参数和元数据 - ToolUniverse 会自动发现已注册的工具"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:153
#: d823cd5f301342d7954fda38fd4e9ee0
msgid ""
"**BaseTool Class** - All tools must inherit from ``BaseTool`` - Implement"
" the ``run(arguments)`` method with your logic - Return a dictionary with"
" ``success`` and result data"
msgstr ""
"**BaseTool 类** - 所有工具必须继承 ``BaseTool`` - 使用您的逻辑实现 ``run(arguments)`` 方法 -"
" 返回一个包含 ``success`` 和结果数据的字典"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:158
#: 54471b7003474a4db4eecb649f7704a9
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Tool Execution** - Use ``tu.run()`` to execute tools - Pass tool name "
"and arguments as a dictionary - ToolUniverse handles parameter validation"
" and execution"
msgstr ""
"**工具执行** - 使用 ``tu.run_one_function()`` 执行工具 - 将工具名称和参数以字典形式传递 - "
"ToolUniverse 负责参数验证和执行"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:163
#: 16a25dcb6b634e18b89582654919b241
msgid ""
"**Parameter Validation** - ToolUniverse automatically validates "
"parameters based on your config - Required parameters are enforced - Type"
" checking happens automatically"
msgstr "**参数验证** - ToolUniverse 会根据您的配置自动验证参数 - 强制执行必需参数 - 自动进行类型检查"

