#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:182
#: ccc59632de7f4a5290142152ce2a90df
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"** Advanced Features:** - Add input validation with ``validate_input()`` "
"method - Implement error handling and retry logic - Add caching and "
"performance optimizations - Create more complex tools with multiple "
"operations"
msgstr ""
"**🔧 高级功能：**  \n"
"- 使用 ``validate_input()`` 方法添加输入验证  \n"
"- 实现错误处理和重试逻辑  \n"
"- 添加缓存和性能优化  \n"
"- 创建具有多种操作的更复杂工具"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:188
#: e0f58b10a1df430b938eeb4828fe62ba
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"** Pro Tips:** - Start simple and add complexity gradually - Test your "
"tools thoroughly before contributing - Use meaningful parameter names and"
" descriptions - Follow the existing tool patterns in the codebase"
msgstr ""
"**💡 专业提示：**  \n"
"- 从简单开始，逐步增加复杂性  \n"
"- 在提交之前彻底测试您的工具  \n"
"- 使用有意义的参数名称和描述  \n"
"- 遵循代码库中现有的工具模式"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:195
#: a002e1d6fa9442f1a8b568365f7082a9
msgid "Common Questions"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:197
#: 61934dcaa2024ccba048886cab594663
msgid ""
"**Q: Can I put the tool in a different file?** A: Yes! Just make sure to "
"import it where you use ToolUniverse."
msgstr ""
"**Q: 我可以将工具放在不同的文件中吗？**  \n"
"A: 可以！只需确保在使用 ToolUniverse 的地方导入它即可。"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:200
#: fbff026c1d054ffd85a55f948333f130
msgid ""
"**Q: What if I want to add more operations?** A: Just add them to the "
"``enum`` list in the config and implement them in the ``run()`` method."
msgstr ""
"**问：如果我想添加更多操作怎么办？**  \n"
"**答：只需将它们添加到配置中的``enum``列表，并在``run()``方法中实现即可。**"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:203
#: 2b59ae60191e466f8b161a1fdc8a33af
msgid ""
"**Q: Can I use this tool in other projects?** A: Yes! Copy the tool file "
"and import it in any project that has ToolUniverse installed."
msgstr ""
"**Q: 我可以在其他项目中使用这个工具吗？**  \n"
"A: 可以！复制工具文件并将其导入到任何安装了 ToolUniverse 的项目中。"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:206
#: 9d9d6d1d4bb74d3da6c7023e6506e4a1
msgid ""
"**Q: How do I handle errors better?** A: Add a ``validate_input()`` "
"method to your tool class for custom validation."
msgstr ""
"**问：如何更好地处理错误？**  \n"
"答：在您的工具类中添加一个``validate_input()``方法，用于自定义验证。"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/quick_start.rst:209
#: 2d25ce7e3e104ec99a82167a138c7613
msgid ""
"**Q: Can I make this a remote tool?** A: Yes! See "
":doc:`remote_tools/tutorial` for creating MCP servers."
msgstr ""
"**问：我可以将其设置为远程工具吗？**  \n"
"答：可以！请参阅 :doc:`remote_tools/tutorial` 了解创建 MCP 服务器的教程。"

